      <data key="relation_type">topical_similarity</data>
      <data key="rationale">Both documents focus on molecular docking and binding affinity in the context of drug design, with the source using docking scores to guide molecular generation and the target employing docking and protein-ligand interactions to prioritize compounds in structure-based drug design. This shared use of docking and binding affinity estimation provides a specific scientific connection.</data>
