      <data key="rationale">Both documents focus on analyzing protein dynamics from molecular dynamics simulations using graph-based representations of residue interactions. The source uses residue interaction networks and random walk embeddings, while the target employs spatiotemporal graph neural networks to identify functional conformational signatures, indicating a shared research topic and methodological approach in protein dynamics analysis.</data>
